OL,5,G0100 #Text Me When You Get Home
OL,6,     FQueena Phu, 18, was brutally
OL,7,     Fattacked and left for dead after
OL,8,     Freturning a library book. Her
OL,9,     Ffriend Rachel found her
OL,10,     Funconscious. Queena survived - but
OL,11,     Fis permanently disabled.
OL,12,G0155 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FDr Adil Sheraz helps a patient
OL,14,     Fwho's been quoted #4500 elsewhere
OL,15,     Fto remove his five head cysts. Dr
OL,16,     FEmma McMullen turns detective to
OL,17,     Fget to the bottom of a mystery
OL,18,     Fskin condition.
